.spec-kit/runs/
.spec-kit/runs-manual/

# Expo metro cache
.expo/

# Expo CNG (prebuild) native output — regenerated from app.json + tracked
# config plugins (apps/mobile/plugins/with-*.js) via `expo prebuild` /
# `expo run:android|ios`. This is a CNG project: neither native dir is
# version-controlled. Local dev-client builds land here; fully regenerable.
apps/mobile/android/
apps/mobile/ios/

# Playwright artifacts
playwright-report/
playwright-test-results/

# runtime-smoke 截图归档（per-feature 本地 debug 留痕，volatile，不入库）
apps/mobile/runtime-debug/

# .env.production is now TRACKED (non-secret prod config; repo is public).
# Secrets live encrypted in secrets.enc.env (SOPS), never in .env.production —
# check-env-sync Check F + gitleaks enforce. (Was gitignored pre-SOPS cutover.)
# Prod deploy state (live on the SWAS host only, never committed): timestamped
# env backups from deploy.yml / rollback-prod.sh + the last-verified-healthy
# image tag baseline used for auto/manual rollback.
.env.production.bak-*
.last-good-tag

# SOPS/age secrets（spike 见 docs/private/plans/2026-06/06-15-sops-age-secrets-adoption-spike.md）。
#
# 🔁 2026-08-08 反转：密文**不再入库**。仓转公开后，「密文一旦公开就永久公开」是不可
# 撤销的 —— 将来 age 私钥一旦泄漏，历史上每一版密文都能被回溯解密，而那时已无从收回。
# key 名仍留仓内（.env.production 侧 + check-env-sync 的对账契约），它本来就是明文；
# 出仓的只有密文本体。判据见 docs/conventions/information-boundary.md。
#
# 密文的三处常驻：dev 机 ~/.nvy/secrets.enc.env（canonical，`sops edit` 改这份）/
# prod /etc/nvy/secrets.enc.env（640 root:admin —— deploy 以 admin 跑，root-only 会炸）/
# 传播路径见 ops/runbook/secrets-sops.md §3.3。
# NEVER track 任何解密产物或 age 私钥（SPOF，在 ~/.config/sops/age/）。
secrets.enc.env
secrets.dec.env
*.dec.env
*.agekey
keys.txt

# Android signing keystores — NEVER commit (上架签名私钥). EAS manages the
# canonical keystore on its servers; `eas credentials` downloads land here as
# *.jks. Back up offline per ops/runbook/mobile-eas-release.md § keystore.
*.jks
*.keystore
*.p12

# Scratch / exploratory notes — kept locally, not tracked
docs/explore/

# Experience reports — kept locally, not tracked (2026-06-05 decision)
docs/experience/

# 拓扑 / 凭据相邻的运维散文 —— 仓已公开，这些永不入 git（2026-08-08 决定）。
# 判据见 docs/conventions/information-boundary.md「私有散文」一层：内容本身即
# 情报（主机清单、RAM 用户↔权限↔凭据路径映射、实盘系统脆弱窗口、自然人位置），
# 不是靠脱敏标识符就能公开的。docs/private/plans/ 收原 docs/plans/ 全部。
# ⚠️ 备份只有私有归档仓在 split 时点的冻结副本，此后的编辑只存在于本机一块盘上
# —— 而 index / broker-hk / 证书续期的重建步骤只活在这些文件里。
docs/private/

# SDD mockup 留迹 —— local-only（2026-08-08 决定）。design/ 装真机截图 + claude-design
# handoff bundle：截图里可能有真实账户 / 持仓 / 手机号，而「像素里的 PII」没有任何扫描器
# 能抓（per docs/conventions/information-boundary.md）。留迹价值不变，只是不入库；历史
# 副本在私有归档仓。`/mockup-gen` 照常写这里。
# ⚠️ 少了这条，下一个 UI feature 就会把截图重新带回公开仓。
specs/*/design/

# SDD auto-impl run artifacts — per-run audit JSONL (Track 1), local-only
.sdd-run/

# Spike / PoC scratch (e.g. S1 code-index bake-off) — throwaway, not tracked
.spikes/

# Ideation headless mockup previews (per-session, regenerated each critique loop) — local-only
.ideation-mockups/
